v2 273 by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7450 add exemplar reservoir parallel benchmark by dashpol in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7441 chore dep updat modul github com ghostiam protogett to v0 3 17 by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7451 chore dep updat action stale action to v10 10 by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7452\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"8765f6c08a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"id\": \"9d142db58d7bf4f6\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.408099736358165, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.23752523765452146, \"vector_similarity\": 0.8061069, \"dataset_name\": \"C2Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"8765f6c08a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"location\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 52878, \"chunk_count\": 30, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:53:51\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:09:56\", \"token_count\": 15994, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"- Return partial OTLP export errors to the caller in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/otlp/otlplog/otlploggrpc`. (#7372)\\n\\n- Return partial OTLP export errors to the caller in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/otlp/otlplog/otlploghttp`. (#7372)\\n\\n- Return partial OTLP export errors to the caller in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/otlp/otlpmetric/otlpmetricgrpc`. (#7372)\\n\\n- Return partial OTLP export errors to the caller in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/otlp/otlpmetric/otlpmetrichttp`. (#7372)\\n\\n- Return partial OTLP export errors to the caller in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/otlp/otlptrace/otlptracegrpc`. (#7372)\\n\\n- Return partial OTLP export errors to the caller in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/otlp/otlptrace/otlptracehttp`. (#7372)\\n\\n- Fix `AddAttributes`, `SetAttributes`, `SetBody` on `Record` in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk/log` to not mutate input. (#7403)\\n\\n- Do not double record measurements of `RecordSet` methods in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/semconv/v1.37.0`. (#7655)\\n\\n- Do not double record measurements of `RecordSet` methods in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/semconv/v1.36.0`. (#7656)\\n\\n### Removed\\n\\n- Drop support for [Go 1.23]. (#7274)\\n\\n- Remove the `FilterProcessor` interface in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk/log`. The `Enabled` method has been added to the `Processor` interface instead. All `Processor` implementations must now implement the `Enabled` method. Custom processors that do not filter records can implement `Enabled` to return `true`. (#7639)\\n\\n**Source ID**: [SRC-REL-01]\\n\\n# Release: v1.39.0 — Release v1.39.0/v0.61.0/v0.15.0/v0.0.14\\n\\n**Canonical URL**: https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/releases/tag/v1.39.0  \\n\\n**Author**: MrAlias  \\n\\n**Created**: 2025-12-08T16:32:32Z · **Updated**: 2025-12-08T16:45:46Z  \\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"return partial otlp export error to the caller in go opentelemetri io otel export otlp otlplog otlploggrpc 7372 return partial otlp export error to the caller in go opentelemetri io otel export otlp otlplog otlploghttp 7372 return partial otlp export error to the caller in go opentelemetri io otel export otlp otlpmetr otlpmetricgrpc 7372 return partial otlp export error to the caller in go opentelemetri io otel export otlp otlpmetr otlpmetrichttp 7372 return partial otlp export error to the caller in go opentelemetri io otel export otlp otlptrac otlptracegrpc 7372 return partial otlp export error to the caller in go opentelemetri io otel export otlp otlptrac otlptracehttp 7372 fix addattribut setattribut setbodi on record in go opentelemetri io otel sdk log to not mutat input 7403 do not doubl record measur of recordset method in go opentelemetri io otel semconv v1 37 0 7655 do not doubl record measur of recordset method in go opentelemetri io otel semconv v1 360 7656 remov drop support for go 123 7274 remov the filterprocessor interfac in go opentelemetri io otel sdk log the enabl method ha been ad to the processor interfac instead all processor implement must now implement the enabl method custom processor that do not filter record can implement enabl to return true 7639 sourc id src rel 01 releas v1 39 0 releas v1 39 0 v0 61 0 v0 15 0 v0 0 14 canon url http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go releas tag v1 39 0 author mralia creat 2025 12 08t16 32 32z updat 2025 12 08t16 45 46z\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"8765f6c08a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"id\": \"2b3a16f34fc9921d\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.39623969465332354, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.20860289236189078, \"vector_similarity\": 0.8340589, \"dataset_name\": \"C2Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"8765f6c08a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"location\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 52878, \"chunk_count\": 30, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:53:51\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:09:56\", \"token_count\": 15994, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"- Improve performance of histogram `Record` in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk/metric` when min and max are disabled using `NoMinMax`. (#7306)\\n\\n- Improve error handling for dropped data during translation by using `prometheus.NewInvalidMetric` in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/prometheus`. ⚠️ **Breaking Change:** Previously, these cases were only logged and scrapes succeeded. Now, when translation would drop data (e.g., invalid label/value), the exporter emits a `NewInvalidMetric`, and Prometheus scrapes **fail with HTTP 500** by default. To preserve the prior behavior (scrapes succeed while errors are logged), configure your Prometheus HTTP handler with: `promhttp.HandlerOpts{ ErrorHandling: promhttp.ContinueOnError }`. (#7363)\\n\\n- Replace fnv hash with xxhash in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/attribute` for better performance. (#7371)\\n\\n- The default `TranslationStrategy` in `go.opentelemetry.io/exporters/prometheus` is changed from `otlptranslator.NoUTF8EscapingWithSuffixes` to `otlptranslator.UnderscoreEscapingWithSuffixes`. (#7421)\\n\\n- Improve performance of concurrent measurements in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk/metric`. (#7427)\\n\\n- Include W3C TraceFlags (bits 0–7) in the OTLP `Span.Flags` field in `go.opentelemetry.io/exporters/otlp/otlptrace/otlptracehttp` and `go.opentelemetry.io/exporters/otlp/otlptrace/otlptracegrpc`. (#7438)\\n\\n- The `ErrorType` function in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/semconv/v1.37.0` now handles custom error types.\\n\\n  If an error implements an `ErrorType() string` method, the return value of that method will be used as the error type. (#7442)\\n\\n### Fixed\\n\\n- Fix `WithInstrumentationAttributes` options in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/trace`, `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/metric`, and `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/log` to properly merge attributes when passed multiple times instead of replacing them. Attributes with duplicate keys will use the last value passed. (#7300)\\n\\n- The equality of `attribute.Set` when using the `Equal` method is not affected by the user overriding the empty set pointed to by `attribute.EmptySet` in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/attribute`. (#7357)\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"improv perform of histogram record in go opentelemetri io otel sdk metric when min and max are disabl use nominmax 7306 improv error handl for drop data dure translat by use prometheus newinvalidmetr in go opentelemetri io otel export prometheus break chang previous these case were onli log and scrape succeed now when translat would drop data e g invalid label valu the export emit a newinvalidmetr and prometheus scrape fail with http 500 by default to preserv the prior behavior scrape succeed while error are log configur your prometheus http handler with promhttp handleropt errorhandl promhttp continueonerror 7363 replac fnv hash with xxhash in go opentelemetri io otel attribut for better perform 7371 the default translationstrategi in go opentelemetri io export prometheus is chang from otlptransl noutf8escapingwithsuffixes to otlptransl underscoreescapingwithsuffix 7421 improv perform of concurr measur in go opentelemetri io otel sdk metric 7427 includ w3c traceflag bit 0 7 in the otlp span flag field in go opentelemetri io export otlp otlptrac otlptracehttp and go opentelemetri io export otlp otlptrac otlptracegrpc 7438 the errortyp function in go opentelemetri io otel semconv v1 37 0 now handl custom error type if an error implement an errortyp string method the return valu of that method will be use a the error type 7442 fix fix withinstrumentationattribut option in go opentelemetri io otel trace go opentelemetri io otel metric and go opentelemetri io otel log to proper merg attribut when pass multipl time instead of replac them attribut with duplic key will use the last valu pass 7300 the equal of attribut set when use the equal method is not affect by the user overrid the empti set point to by attribut emptyset in go opentelemetri io otel attribut 7357\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_