{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"agent_message","text":"No—custom temporality-selector configuration snippets were not supported; the SIG recommended using the full OpenTelemetry configuration-file format instead. [SRC-NOTE-03]\n\nOpenTelemetry Go `v1.39.0` did ship predefined selector functions in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk/metric`:\n\n- `DeltaTemporalitySelector`\n- `CumulativeTemporalitySelector`\n- `LowMemoryTemporalitySelector`\n\n[SRC-REL-01]"}}
